#==============================================================================================
#
#   selector_parsing_1 - parsing selectors: entry points, selector lists, complex and compound
#                        selectors, combinators, qualified names
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/Parser/SelectorParsing.cpp (lines 1-388): next_is_pseudo_element,
#       the parse_as_* entry points, create_invalid_selector, <selector-list> (the template
#       over TokenStream<T>), <complex-selector>, <compound-selector>, combinators and
#       <wq-name>.
#
#       ParseErrorOr<T> is `T!` failing with the codes of parser_1
#       (css_parser_parse_error_syntax_error, ..._includes_ignored_vendor_prefix).
